/// Checks the algebraic consistency of packed DSA public components of widths 128/20 bytes. Keeps the 32-bit mask at workspace byte 116 when all checks pass, otherwise clears it; writes q-2 as 20 big-endian bytes at byte 14912. Only workspace ranges 0..64, 116..120, 168..204, 256..15712 may change. This does not check primality or supported bit lengths. Constant time with respect to key values and the incoming mask.
///
/// Contract: `VG.Spec.Dsa.PublicValidation.contract`.
///
/// # Safety
///
